@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title Bounded event journal: publish, retain, read
participant "Trusted producer" as P
participant "Event journal\n(reference host)" as J
participant "Consumer" as C
P -> J: publish({completion, trace, settingsState?, events})
alt any check fails
  J --> P: reject; journal unchanged (retry allowed)
else whole batch valid
  J -> J: assign sequences N+1..N+k\n(none if events = [])
  J -> J: keep newest `capacity` events
  J -> J: replace latest snapshot
  J --> P: published records + snapshot + nextCursor
end
C -> J: read({cursor: afterSequence = 10})
J --> C: gaps [11..13, "retention"]\nevents from 14\nlatest snapshot (separate)\nnextCursor
note right of C
  No synthetic events for 11-13.
  Save nextCursor only after processing.
end note
@enduml
